00:00:15.671 --> 00:00:17.569
WHAT IS TODAY FALLS CHURCH,

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:19.281
VIRGINIA, WAS AN EARLY COLONIAL

00:00:19.315 --> 00:00:20.647
SETTLEMENT DATING BACK TO THE

00:00:20.682 --> 00:00:22.071
LATE 1600s.

00:00:22.072 --> 00:00:24.786
