00:00:27.174 --> 00:00:28.015
CHURCH, AN EPISCOPAL

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:28.677
CONGREGATION.

00:00:28.711 --> 00:00:31.336
IT DIDN’T BECOME ITS OWN

00:00:31.371 --> 00:00:35.208
INDEPENDENT CITY UNTIL 1948 WHEN

00:00:35.209 --> 00:00:36.345
PARENTS SUCCESSFULLY OBTAINED

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.299
SEPARATION FROM FAIRFAX COUNTY

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:42.682
IN AN EFFORT TO ESTABLISH A

00:00:42.684 --> 00:00:44.452
HIGHLY ACCLAIMED SCHOOL SYSTEM.

00:00:44.453 --> 00:00:47.324
72 YEARS LATER, FALLS CHURCH HAS

00:00:47.326 --> 00:00:49.001
ABANDONED ITS ORIGINAL MISSION.

00:00:49.003 --> 00:00:51.369
JUST AS HUNDREDS OF SCHOOL

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:53.114
SYSTEMS ACROSS AMERICA ARE USING

